# Privacy Policy for AussiePostcodeFinder

**Last Updated:** May 22, 2026

At **AussiePostcodeFinder**, we value your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we handle information when you use our mobile application (the "App"). 

By using the App, you agree to the terms outlined in this policy.

---

### 1. Information Collection and Use

* **User Data:** AussiePostcodeFinder does not collect, store, transmit, or share any personally identifiable information (PII) or user data. We do not require you to create an account, log in, or provide any personal details to use the App.
* **Device Permissions:** The App requires internet access solely to retrieve up-to-date postcode information and to display advertisements. 

---

### 2. Third-Party Advertising (Google Ads)

We use Google as a third-party ad vendor to display advertisements at the bottom of the App. To make this work, Google uses tracking technologies:

* **Cookies and Device Identifiers:** Google and its partners use identifiers (such as the Android Advertising ID) to serve ads based on your visits to this App and/or other sites on the Internet.
* **Personalized Advertising:** Google may serve personalized ads to you. You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting your device's Google settings or by visiting [www.aboutads.info](https://www.aboutads.info).

For more details on how Google manages data in its ad network, please review the [Google Privacy & Terms](https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads).

---

### 3. Children's Privacy

Our App is safe for everyone and does not knowingly collect any personal information from children under the age of 13. Since we do not collect any user data, we are compliant with COPPA (Children's Online Privacy Protection Act) and similar global privacy regulations.

---

### 4. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last Updated" date. You are advised to review this page periodically for any changes.

